# Build output.
target/
release/
.rustc_info.json

# Local state for the /impeccable review tool. Machine-local, never shared.
.impeccable/

# Generated by the /graphify skill: a code-graph snapshot of this repo, plus its AST
# cache. Analysis output, not part of JII — regenerate it, never commit it.
graphify-out/

# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. JII ships prebuilt binaries, so a released
# tag has to name one exact dependency set (ADR-0081), and CI/release both build with
# `--locked` — without the lockfile they fail before they compile.

# Agent working files. These steer whatever assistant is helping build JII — they are
# instructions *to a tool*, not part of the program and not documentation of it, so
# they stay on the maintainer's machine rather than in the published tree. Removing
# them here does not delete them locally, and does not touch the commits that already
# contain them.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
docs/AI_CONTEXT.md
